1
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:53,280
Have you

2
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:55,000
finished that book?

3
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,640
I finished the first volume

4
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:58,400
and want to read the second.

5
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:07,000
But we can read it together.

6
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:11,920
I'll read it with you from the beginning.

7
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:12,240
Fried Rice Cakes

8
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:12,600
BBQ & Dumplings

9
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:13,280
Hi.

10
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:16,680
Qingqing, you're here. Have a seat.

11
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,440
I'll have a bowl of Wanza noodles

12
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:19,880
and a half portion
of wontons in chili oil.

13
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:21,960
Plus a duck head and a duck foot, right?

14
00:01:21,960 --> 00:01:22,800
Exactly.

15
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:23,920
Alright. Take a seat,

16
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:25,380
it'll be ready in a minute.

17
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:40,880
Here you go.

18
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:42,880
Thank you.

19
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:43,880
Enjoy.

20
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:54,000
These Chongqing noodles
are the most authentic.

21
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,200
They're fragrant, numbing, and spicy.

22
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:01,360
And these wontons have thin wrappers
and generous fillings.

23
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:02,160
Try them.

24
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:12,180
Delicious, right?

25
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:13,760
This is my hidden gem.

26
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,680
I don't just tell anyone about it.

27
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:16,680
It's really good.

28
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:11,360
What should we have for lunch today?

29
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:15,450
I'm getting tired of the cafeteria's
spicy hot pot. How about we...

30
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:16,520
Qingqing,

31
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:17,960
look!

32
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:20,020
The genius from the math department.

33
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:21,360
No, I gotta practice my combos.

34
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,600
You broke my combo.

35
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,760
Can you put

36
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:26,720
this tireless energy

37
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:28,240
into something else?

38
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,520
Like studying?

39
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:31,560
Like chasing guys.

40
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,760
Now that 2847 is gone,

41
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:35,160
I have to carry on his legacy

42
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:36,880
and strive for the top
of the national server.

43
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:37,400
For us,

44
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:39,320
it's about spiritual enjoyment.

45
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:40,560
You wouldn't understand.

46
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,960
You think I don't understand?

47
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:43,280
You just don't.

48
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:51,560
Just like that, a captivating smile,

49
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,680
unforgettable at first sight.

50
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:11,200
Qingqing,

51
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:13,960
I got this

52
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:15,800
jasmine green milk tea

53
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:17,880
from a new shop near our school.

54
00:04:17,880 --> 00:04:19,760
30% sugar, no ice, with boba.

55
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:20,860
Your favorite.

56
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,360
Thank you.

57
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:23,720
Jialing,

58
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:24,760
I got this for you.

59
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:25,880
Grape Four Seasons Spring tea.

60
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:26,840
And mine.

61
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:28,000
Thanks.

62
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:30,680
I guess I'm benefiting from Qingqing.

63
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:37,440
Impressive, Zhang Yi.

64
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:39,180
You know Qingqing so well.

65
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:40,080
Didn't we just

66
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:41,480
mention yesterday we wanted to try

67
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,280
this new shop?

68
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:43,800
And you brought it over today.

69
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:44,960
It was just a guess.

70
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:47,130
I saw a lot of girls lining up there.

71
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:49,600
I just knew you'd love it.

72
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:52,520
Are you interested in our Qingqing?

73
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:01,000
Who was the guy
that gave you milk tea today?

74
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,680
Do you already have a boyfriend?

75
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:20,040
How could I keep
such a good thing all to myself?

76
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:22,040
I'll forward it
to Tang Jialing right away.

77
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,600
Besties share the good stuff.

78
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:24,920
What do you think of me?

79
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:37,200
I love it so much. It's wonderful.

80
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:39,600
We women need to see things like this

81
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,530
to have the energy to make a living.

82
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:46,840
I'm so sorry.

83
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:48,240
My bestie sent this to me,

84
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,960
and I accidentally forwarded it to you.

85
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:51,200
I'm a decent person.

86
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:52,480
I never watch these things.

87
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:54,280
I was just about to criticize
this kind of behavior.

88
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:55,120
There's nothing to see here.

89
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,450
You should close it too.

90
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:02,160
I have them too,
and they're no worse than theirs.

91
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,160
Do you want to see?

92
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:05,520
Look,

93
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,520
Star Remains has
a new relationship system.

94
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:09,840
Players can form various relationships,

95
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:11,440
like lovers or best friends.

96
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:12,640
And the rewards are really rich.

97
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:13,400
What do you say?

98
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:14,640
Wanna log back in?

99
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:29,320
Reaching level five in a romance
gives you an outfit.

100
00:06:29,320 --> 00:06:30,520
It's so pretty!

101
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:32,240
Why don't we become a couple

102
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,570
and do quests together?

103
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:38,040
Do you know what this romance entails?

104
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,400
I do.

105
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:41,760
I've researched it thoroughly.

106
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:43,560
We have to do daily events together,

107
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:45,000
take photos, form a pact,

108
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:46,680
invite friends for blessings, and stuff.

109
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:49,200
I heard we'll build
and decorate a house together later.

110
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:51,680
There might even be an option
to have kids.

111
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:59,240
You are my first...

112
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:03,680
First what?

113
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:05,000
First love?

114
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:06,840
You're my first too.

115
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,200
One last piece,

116
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:19,730
and the puzzle is complete.

117
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:21,610
Can I make a wish in advance?

118
00:07:25,400 --> 00:07:26,720
What's your wish?

119
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:31,400
I want to meet you.

120
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:37,680
Okay, let's meet then.

121
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,320
Qingqing,

122
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,600
the market is having a sale tomorrow.

123
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,920
We'll head over there
first thing in the morning.

124
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,840
I must get that coat,

125
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:48,760
the best value of the year.

126
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:53,200
I'm meeting 2847 tomorrow.

127
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:55,200
Under the 28th tree,

128
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:57,130
where I put the first puzzle piece.

129
00:07:58,640 --> 00:08:00,200
You're actually serious.

130
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,940
I thought you were joking.

131
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,640
What's wrong? Let me see.

132
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:16,360
Sister,

133
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:18,000
he's calling you sister.

134
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,360
This year's tea is hitting the market.

135
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,320
This is our tea garden.

136
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:22,120
Do you need

137
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:25,440
to buy some?

138
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:28,800
Our tea garden is the best in this estate.

139
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:31,560
I'd be thrilled if you could buy some.

140
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:34,480
Isn't this a classic pig-butchering scam?

141
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:36,240
Now he's asking you to buy tea.

142
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:41,320
So this 2847 has been fattening you up
for the slaughter.

143
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:45,090
After stringing you along for so long,

144
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:47,600
he's finally going in for the kill.

145
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,930
A pig-butchering scam?

146
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,280
Me?

147
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:52,720
Yeah.

148
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,240
Is this guy

149
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:56,480
super good at the game,

150
00:08:57,600 --> 00:09:00,840
but constantly facing
setbacks in real life?

151
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,570
I entered a competition

152
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,260
and failed miserably.

153
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:06,200
Math is a game for geniuses.

154
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,760
And then he needs someone like you,

155
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:10,520
an ignorant, pure, and naive girl

156
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:12,200
to comfort him, save him,

157
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,880
and help him rebuild his confidence.

158
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:15,760
It gives you

159
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:18,600
a sense of accomplishment,

160
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,320
like you've saved a broken man.

161
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:22,200
Then he'll ask you to fund him

162
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,000
and help him make a comeback.

163
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:28,480
Now that you mention it,
it really seems like it.

164
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,400
But if he's playing with my feelings,

165
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:32,260
why is he in such a hurry to meet me?

166
00:09:36,520 --> 00:09:38,400
You're meeting tomorrow, right?

167
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:41,200
And he asked you to buy tea today.

168
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:43,040
Which means...

169
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:46,640
It means he's most likely an ugly guy.

170
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:48,080
Afraid the offline meeting
will be a disaster.

171
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,480
Afraid you'll be completely
disappointed in him.

172
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:49,920
And then...

173
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:51,160
he won't be able to fleece

174
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:53,400
a little piggy like you anymore.

175
00:10:01,520 --> 00:10:02,360
Qingqing,

176
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:04,760
this isn't your fault.

177
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:07,480
You're just too innocent and kind,

178
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:10,480
which is why those filthy scammers
always target you.

179
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,560
They can play with my feelings,

180
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:17,560
but not my money.

181
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,520
I guess I just trusted the wrong person.

182
00:10:21,520 --> 00:10:22,360
Cancel.

183
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,690
Xinghai has been uninstalled.

184
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,160
From now on,

185
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:33,820
I'm quitting the game
and staying off the internet.

186
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:07,800
Where are you?

187
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:09,450
Do you need me to pick you up?

188
00:11:40,920 --> 00:11:41,520
Shen,

189
00:11:41,760 --> 00:11:42,840
why did your little romance

190
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:44,320
announce her relationship with my junior?

191
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:45,880
They are classmates, right?

192
00:11:45,880 --> 00:11:46,960
I heard from my junior

193
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:49,290
that he's been chasing her
for a long time.

194
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,920
I'm sorry, Qingqing.

195
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:07,600
I was young

196
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:09,040
and ignorant back then.

197
00:12:09,040 --> 00:12:12,520
My parents said they'd give me
pocket money if I sold tea.

198
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:15,320
So I mass-messaged everyone.

199
00:12:15,640 --> 00:12:18,640
I not only used my smartwatch

200
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,960
but also my brother's phone.

201
00:12:21,040 --> 00:12:23,520
I just wanted to earn some pocket money.

202
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:25,320
It's okay, it's okay.

203
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,800
It's good
that the misunderstanding is cleared up.

204
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:28,120
It's not a big deal.

205
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:31,560
Look, you're crying like a little cat.

206
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:32,520
Go wash your face.

207
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:33,240
Go on.

208
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:34,960
Go ahead.

209
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:39,440
You just deleted me

210
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:40,760
and wouldn't listen to my explanation.

211
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:42,360
Is that not a big deal either?

212
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,680
There were too many
telecom scams back then.

213
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:48,320
I was just being cautious.

214
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,400
If others knew

215
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:50,960
I chatted with a scammer for so long

216
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:52,220
and almost fell for it,

217
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:54,740
it would be really embarrassing.

218
00:12:55,560 --> 00:12:56,360
Yun Qingqing,

219
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:58,240
you said you wanted to be
my romance back then...

220
00:12:58,240 --> 00:12:59,480
Are you just messing with me?
